Package: traitintegration
Type: Package
Title: Visualizatiion and analysis of trait integration
Version: 0.1
Author: Kent Holsinger <kent.holsinger@uconn.edu>
Maintainer: Kent Holsinger <kent.holsinger@uconn.edu>
Description: This package provides function to visualize the posterior distribution of correlation matrices and to calculate and report the posterior distribution of integration statistics: (1) the maximum eigenvalue of the correlation matrix, (2) the variance of eigenvalues, and (3) the value of the correlation coefficient in a constant correlation matrix that produces the same entropy as the observed correlation matrix.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
